OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for daylight zombie
OL,4,Aknife stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who stabbed his victim with a
OL,7,Fzombie knife in a town street has been
OL,8,Fjailed.
OL,10,FLuke Hurdowar pulled up in a car
OL,11,Falongside the other man in Cotmanhay
OL,12,FRoad, Cotmanhay, near Ilkeston, just
OL,13,Fafter noon on 26 June.
OL,15,FThe pair, who knew each other, began
OL,16,Farguing and after the victim threw
OL,17,Fpunches at him, 24-year-old Hurdowar
OL,18,Fpulled a 30cm knife from the waistband
OL,19,Fof his trousers and stabbed him twice
OL,20,Fbefore driving away.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
